{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34431","headline":"和袭美新秋即事次韵三首 一 · 陆龟蒙","name":"和袭美新秋即事次韵三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"心似孤云任所之，世尘中更有谁知。\n愁寻冷落惊双鬓，病得清凉减四支。\n怀旧药溪终独往，宿枯杉寺已频期。\n兼须爲月求高处，即是霜轮杀满时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34431.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34431","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}